# API & Authentication Patterns

This project uses Axios for HTTP requests with JWT-based authentication. Follow these patterns for consistent API integration.

## API Configuration
Main configuration in [src/API/index.ts](mdc:src/API/index.ts):

### Axios Instance
```typescript
export const api = axios.create({
  baseURL: configs.apiBaseUrl
})
```

### Authentication Headers
```typescript
export function auth(): IRequestHeader {
  if (typeof window === 'undefined') {
    return {}
  }

  const headers = { Authorization: '' }
  const accessToken = localStorage.getItem(AuthenticateParams.ACCESS_TOKEN) || ''
  headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${accessToken}`

  return headers
}
```

